he Ukrainian Army back in control  residents here long to put the dark days  of War behind them  and see the Ukrainian flag rise over the  country once again  well my first guest tonight is a  zielinski Insider from June 2019 to June  2021 Yulia Mendel served as the  spokesperson for Ukrainian President  Vladimir zielinski it would be the  crucial foundation for her new book  published this week which is entitled  the fight of Our Lives my time with  zelinski Ukraine's battle for democracy  and what it means for the world  Julia Mendo joins me tonight from New  York City Julie it's good to have you  with us this evening that the pictures  that we saw today the flag going up over  territory that had been controlled by  the Russians just days ago that flag  being hoisted by zielinski  um how did you feel when you saw those  images  well thank you first for having me so  crane is regaining  and it's really a fascinating  development that all the country has  been waiting for the last seven months  it's like seven months of the battle of  the fight for our very existence and now  when we see and when we have shown to  the world that we can regain the  territories back we hope that the  community International Community will  stay unified and will hope uh will  provide us all the opportunities and  resources to fight Russia out of the  territory of Ukraine you know that one  and a two million of ukrainians still  stay in occupation under Russia and also  Ukraine uh is moving not only in the  northern East and east of the country  but also trying to move to the herself  region which is my hometown region which  is in the South and the country and this  also brings joy to my uh to me that you  know I feel like my own hometown can be  liberated very soon and let me ask you  this rapid Ukrainian advance that we  have seen it it apparently called the  the Russians by surprise were you  surprised at how quickly events unfolded  and how you know this this course of  history beg