 traveling on  the territory of Ukraine and that still  was the Russian Empire what was called  but at the same time in this note it is  written that people see that the life  there is different people are different  foods is different languages different  houses are different identity was  different Ukraine considers that we've  been fighting Russia for the last 400  years but the fight for democracy for  the values the fight for independence of  really Ukraine as an equal and strong  country is happening right now well I'm  sure there are lots of people around the  world who hope the best for you and  Ukraine and hope that this fight for  Freedom you know ends sooner rather than  later Julia Mendel author of the fight  of Our Lives my time with zelinski we  appreciate your time please come back  and talk with us again thank you  thank you for having me

